fpu: DIV.S, SQRT.S and RSQRT.S saturate like the R5900 instead of making host
infinities and NaNs: a zero divisor gives +-FLT_MAX, a negative radicand |x|,
an overflow FLT_MAX. KH2 divided by zero at the start of the second Seifer
fight in the Sandlot; the infinity became NaN positions (black 3D).
ps2FpuDivideByZero(pc) is called at each zero divide (PS2X_FPU_LOG=1 lists
the sites).

